%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0ca23d3e41cd5424c9ec72c610ef25a4, type: 3}
  m_Name: NatsukiGetsAttackedByThalmor
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  autoFocusSpeaker: 1
  screens:
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972359976905080880
    - rid: 4972359976905080881
    - rid: 4972359976905080941
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: In his letter, he said he was going to be waiting here, didn't he?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360613912379461
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: db46f9c9f9769b944946c389f5c0fbec, type: 2}
    dialog: Yes. Maybe he's inside?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972359976905080883
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Natsuki walks up to the door and knocks on it.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972359976905080884
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: <Speed=1>...</Speed>
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Hello? Valmir?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972359976905080885
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6f47b2f061a0a3249992cdd21d6995ed, type: 2}
    dialog: Draw your weapons, we're surrounded!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972359976905080886
    - rid: 4972359976905080887
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: db46f9c9f9769b944946c389f5c0fbec, type: 2}
    dialog: Thalmor?!?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972359976905080888
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: 'The justiciars that''re surrounding the group draw their weapons and
      raise their hands, with one barking out an order from behind:'
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9e25ab63e1eda4459300fa1e62cc430, type: 2}
    dialog: Make sure not to damage the mask while <i>dealing</i> with them!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972359976905080942
    - rid: 4972359976905080943
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Is everyone alright?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972359976905080944
    - rid: 4972359976905081024
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17bd3b6fcae930647918fc183fea836b, type: 2}
    dialog: One of the knife-ears clipped my side, but other than that I'm fine.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972359976905081012
    - rid: 4972359976905081013
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (... was that a slur?!?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972359976905081014
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: db46f9c9f9769b944946c389f5c0fbec, type: 2}
    dialog: I'm good; could use a drink, though...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972359976905081015
    - rid: 4972359976905081017
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6f47b2f061a0a3249992cdd21d6995ed, type: 2}
    dialog: Look what I found...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972359976905081018
    - rid: 4972359976905081025
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9e25ab63e1eda4459300fa1e62cc430, type: 2}
    dialog: Ack-! Let go of me-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972359976905081019
    - rid: 4972359976905081020
    - rid: 4972359976905081021
    - rid: 4972359976905081022
    - rid: 4972359976905081023
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: db46f9c9f9769b944946c389f5c0fbec, type: 2}
    dialog: So, are you, or were one of your cohorts, Valmir? Or was that all just
      a lie to ambush us?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972359976905081026
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9e25ab63e1eda4459300fa1e62cc430, type: 2}
    dialog: My name really <i>is</i> Valmir, not that it would matter.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: db46f9c9f9769b944946c389f5c0fbec, type: 2}
    dialog: I take it that the Thalmor have become interested in the artifacts of
      the Dragon Cult?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9e25ab63e1eda4459300fa1e62cc430, type: 2}
    dialog: Like I'd tell you barbarians that-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9e25ab63e1eda4459300fa1e62cc430, type: 2}
    dialog: Oof-!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360475574796519
    - rid: 4972359976905081028
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: db46f9c9f9769b944946c389f5c0fbec, type: 2}
    dialog: This just some power play? White-Gold not good enough for you fools?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: db46f9c9f9769b944946c389f5c0fbec, type: 2}
    dialog: Or does this mask hold some part in a greater scheme?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9e25ab63e1eda4459300fa1e62cc430, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Valmir quickly shakes off Aela's grasp, pulls out a dagger and-!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972359976905081029
    - rid: 4972359976905081030
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Stabs himself in the gut.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972359976905081032
    - rid: 4972359976905081033
    - rid: 4972359976905081034
    - rid: 4972359976905081035
    - rid: 4972359976905081036
    - rid: 4972360475574796520
    - rid: 4972359999284838476
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972359976905081038
    - rid: 4972359976905081039
    - rid: 4972359976905081040
    - rid: 4972359976905081041
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6f47b2f061a0a3249992cdd21d6995ed, type: 2}
    dialog: Whatever the answer, he'd rather die than tell us.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17bd3b6fcae930647918fc183fea836b, type: 2}
    dialog: Wait, if Valmir was a Thalmor agent, who works this farm?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: db46f9c9f9769b944946c389f5c0fbec, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972359976905081037
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: The actual owners didn't answer when we knocked on the door...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6f47b2f061a0a3249992cdd21d6995ed, type: 2}
    dialog: We should probably be able to find something if we look around.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: The group doesn't have to look far...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972359976905081043
    - rid: 4972359976905081044
    - rid: 4972359976905081045
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: db46f9c9f9769b944946c389f5c0fbec, type: 2}
    dialog: Two more fallen before the elves...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972359976905081047
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6f47b2f061a0a3249992cdd21d6995ed, type: 2}
    dialog: They can rest in peace, knowing we've brought justice to their killers.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: db46f9c9f9769b944946c389f5c0fbec, type: 2}
    dialog: Maybe so, but Skyrim has still lost a son and daughter.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: How did no one notice these two died? They're farmers...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: db46f9c9f9769b944946c389f5c0fbec, type: 2}
    dialog: I'm not sure. We should tell the Riften guard about what happened here.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: The group departs for Riften to inform the proper authorities of the
      political intrigue.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972359976905081046
    - rid: 4972359976905081048
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions: []
